// In-game overlay strings (OVL_*), used by util/ps4_localized.hpp for the RSX overlays (trophy, save list, keyboard,
// game data errors, progress dialog, home menu). Lines of one overlay text are separate ids: a table text has no line
// break. The RSX overlay renderer has no Arabic shaping: with the interface in Arabic the English column is shown (the
// Arabic column is kept for when the overlays can draw it).
// I18N(id, pt-BR, en, es, ar); "" = not translated yet (falls back to English, then pt-BR). Rules in ps4_i18n.hpp.
// UTF-8 without BOM, LF line ends.

